{"title": "Underdark Pleasures", "pageid": 52777, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Underdark_Pleasures", "categories": ["Locations", "Act Three Locations"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:UnderdarkPleasures.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/UnderdarkPleasures.png/300px-UnderdarkPleasures.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/UnderdarkPleasures.png/450px-UnderdarkPleasures.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/UnderdarkPleasures.png/600px-UnderdarkPleasures.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/UnderdarkPleasures.png/300px-UnderdarkPleasures.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"178\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/UnderdarkPleasures.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption><div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">  Underdark Pleasures interior  </div></figcaption></figure><b>Underdark Pleasures</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Location\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Location\">Location</a> within <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\">Wyrm's Crossing</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. It is one of <a href=\"/wiki/Sharess%27_Caress\" title=\"Sharess' Caress\">Sharess' Caress'</a> thematic parlours, in use by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nym_Orlith\" title=\"Nym Orlith\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png/25px-Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png/38px-Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png/50px-Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nym\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png/25px-Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nym_Orlith\" title=\"Nym Orlith\">Nym</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sorn_Orlith\" title=\"Sorn Orlith\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png/25px-Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png/38px-Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png/50px-Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sorn Orlith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png/25px-Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sorn_Orlith\" title=\"Sorn Orlith\">Sorn Orlith</a>. \n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>This room is the farmost of all private rooms of the Sharess' Caress pleasure house. To reach it, the party must come up to the upper floor and walk along all the archway above the Crossing. <b>Underdark Pleasures</b> actually occupies the second floor of the western part of Sharess' Caress, but is still considered a section of the Upper Floor.\n</p><p>The interior of the parlour is stylized to be a cross between the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a> realm and the environment of the <a href=\"/wiki/Gnarled_Teahouse\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gnarled Teahouse\">Gnarled Teahouse</a>, with various giant mushrooms, shabby furniture, glowing bulbs as lanterns, and a young sussur tree in a corner (albeit without a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sussur_Antimagic_Field_(Condition)\" title=\"Sussur Antimagic Field (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Sussur_Flower_Antimagic_Field_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Sussur_Flower_Antimagic_Field_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Sussur_Flower_Antimagic_Field_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sussur_Flower_Antimagic_Field_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Sussur_Flower_Antimagic_Field_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Sussur_Flower_Antimagic_Field_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"magic-sapping effect\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Sussur_Flower_Antimagic_Field_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Sussur_Flower_Antimagic_Field_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Sussur_Flower_Antimagic_Field_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sussur_Antimagic_Field_(Condition)\" title=\"Sussur Antimagic Field (Condition)\">magic-sapping effect</a>). There is almost nothing to loot in this room, except a single <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rogue%27s_Morsel\" title=\"Rogue's Morsel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Rogue%27s_Morsel_Item_Icon.png/20px-Rogue%27s_Morsel_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Rogue%27s_Morsel_Item_Icon.png/30px-Rogue%27s_Morsel_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Rogue%27s_Morsel_Item_Icon.png/40px-Rogue%27s_Morsel_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Rogue%27s_Morsel_Item_Icon.png/20px-Rogue%27s_Morsel_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Rogue%27s_Morsel_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rogue%27s_Morsel\" title=\"Rogue's Morsel\">Rogue's Morsel</a> in the wardrobe, and a bottle of wine.\n</p><p>This room's residents - the drow twins <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sorn_Orlith\" title=\"Sorn Orlith\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png/25px-Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png/38px-Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png/50px-Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sorn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png/25px-Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sorn_Orlith\" title=\"Sorn Orlith\">Sorn</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nym_Orlith\" title=\"Nym Orlith\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png/25px-Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png/38px-Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png/50px-Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nym Orlith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png/25px-Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nym_Orlith\" title=\"Nym Orlith\">Nym Orlith</a> - fled the Underdark due to the matriarchy's mistreatment of men, ultimately coming to work in Baldur's Gate.\n</p><p>The parlour is normally locked, as the twins usually await for another client in the music hall on the ground floor, behind the curtain. Should the player character arrange an encounter with either or both of them - or both at the same time - the drow lead the way to the room and open the door themselves. In their absence, the room can be unlocked by lockpicking or by using <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sharess%27_Caress_Rooms_Key\" title=\"Sharess' Caress Rooms Key\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/20px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/30px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/40px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/20px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sharess%27_Caress_Rooms_Key\" title=\"Sharess' Caress Rooms Key\">Sharess' Caress Rooms Key</a>, obtained from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amira\" title=\"Amira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Amira.png/25px-Portrait_Amira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Amira.png/38px-Portrait_Amira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Amira.png/50px-Portrait_Amira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mamzell Amira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Amira.png/25px-Portrait_Amira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Portrait_Amira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Amira\" title=\"Amira\">Mamzell Amira</a> or taken from the <a href=\"/wiki/Nymph%27s_Grotto\" title=\"Nymph's Grotto\">Nymph's Grotto</a>.\n</p><p>Should the player character use the services of either or both of the twins, speaking to them inside the parlour starts a cutscene, most of which comes with the blackened-out screen, showing the narration and dialogue options only. Despite the Narrator's describing the cutscene as taking all night long, it neither triggers the <a href=\"/wiki/Resting\" title=\"Resting\">Long Rest</a> mechanism, nor adds it a new calendar day to the journal.\n</p><p>After the cutscene ends, all participants remain in the parlour, dressed in their underwear only.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_locations\">Related locations</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sharess%27_Caress\" title=\"Sharess' Caress\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sharess' Caress\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Sharess%27_Caress\" title=\"Sharess' Caress\">Sharess' Caress</a> <br></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wyrm's Crossing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\">Wyrm's Crossing</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nym_Orlith\" title=\"Nym Orlith\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png/30px-Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png/45px-Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png/60px-Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nym Orlith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png/30px-Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nym_Orlith\" title=\"Nym Orlith\">Nym Orlith</a> - optional</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sorn_Orlith\" title=\"Sorn Orlith\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png/30px-Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png/45px-Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png/60px-Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sorn Orlith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png/30px-Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sorn_Orlith\" title=\"Sorn Orlith\">Sorn Orlith</a> - optional</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inspiration\">Inspiration</span></h2>\n<p>Receiving the service from either of the drow grants the following inspiration:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan#Alternative_Vocations\" title=\"Guild Artisan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alternative Vocations\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan#Alternative_Vocations\" title=\"Guild Artisan\">Alternative Vocations</a> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan\" title=\"Guild Artisan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/20px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/30px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/40px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Guild Artisan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/20px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan\" title=\"Guild Artisan\">Guild Artisan</a> background)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte#Carnal_Rituals_of_Sharess\" title=\"Acolyte\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Carnal Rituals of Sharess\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte#Carnal_Rituals_of_Sharess\" title=\"Acolyte\">Carnal Rituals of Sharess</a> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte\" title=\"Acolyte\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png/20px-Background_Acolyte_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png/30px-Background_Acolyte_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png/40px-Background_Acolyte_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acolyte\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png/20px-Background_Acolyte_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte\" title=\"Acolyte\">Acolyte</a> background)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Entertainer#Giving_a_Private_Performance\" title=\"Entertainer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Giving a Private Performance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Entertainer#Giving_a_Private_Performance\" title=\"Entertainer\">Giving a Private Performance</a> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Entertainer\" title=\"Entertainer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Background_Entertainer_Icon.png/20px-Background_Entertainer_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Background_Entertainer_Icon.png/30px-Background_Entertainer_Ico